  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Percentage of chlorine in the organic compound=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>atomic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mass</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>chlorine</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mass</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>formed</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>molecular</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mass</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ofAgCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>weight</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>organic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>compound</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><p>Mass of organic compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AgCl</mi></math>&nbsp;formed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi></math>&nbsp;in organic compound&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>143</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Percentage of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi></math>&nbsp;in the compound&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>143</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>58</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p><p>Nearest integer=40.</p>",
